0..74 Comment "// The wildcard: `_` written where a value is read stands for the term the"
75..141 Comment "// equations force. The elaborator answers it, not the author: the"
142..216 Comment "// solver binds it only where a comparison forces a most general solution,"
217..294 Comment "// the checker writes that solution in its place, and the kernel readmits the"
295..363 Comment "// declaration as if the term were written by hand. A wildcard in an"
364..438 Comment "// ascription\'s type is forced by the term it ascribes. A hole `?h` is the"
439..478 Comment "// author\'s to fill. What refuses is in"
479..524 Comment "// `../../pathological/holes/wildcard.gandr`."
525..527 Comment "//"
528..542 Comment "// - see: #528"
543..597 Comment "// - see: #1979 — `endForced`, `endSigned`, `endMet`"
